%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 582cadc1bc164fa4784fe9c8e993c388, type: 3}
  m_Name: BriefingContent
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: FireReady::FireReady.Config.BriefingContent
  pages:
  - title: Your goal
    body: A fire has started in a small workshop office. Three fires will start one
      after another, and you have four extinguishers on a stand.
    items:
    - heading: Raise the alarm
      text: Tap the red call point first so everyone is warned.
      icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: dab64efca8ca4df4abc258e29ff3007d, type: 3}
      color: {r: 1, g: 0.27058825, b: 0.22745098, a: 1}
    - heading: Put out each fire
      text: A paper bin, a fuel spill and an overloaded extension board.
      icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3f18390c4ec53cb41add00004a707db6, type: 3}
      color: {r: 0.9411765, g: 0.3529412, b: 0.15686275, a: 1}
    - heading: Cut the power
      text: Switch off the breaker before you tackle the electrical fire.
      icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c865e3aeffd2ecb4592620ff605eaeea, type: 3}
      color: {r: 1, g: 0.6901961, b: 0.1254902, a: 1}
    - heading: Know when to leave
      text: If a fire gets out of control, walk to the EXIT and tap it.
      icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4fa7b3dfe1c4cb64dac9caddde800449, type: 3}
      color: {r: 0.20392157, g: 0.78039217, b: 0.34901962, a: 1}
  - title: Pick the right extinguisher
    body: The coloured band on each extinguisher tells you what is inside.
    items:
    - heading: Water (red)
      text: Paper, wood, fabric. Never on fuel or live electrics.
      icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3d094e70ca30eff47ab118e0663ba5cb, type: 3}
      color: {r: 0.8392157, g: 0.15686275, b: 0.15686275, a: 1}
    - heading: Foam (cream)
      text: Paper and burning fuel. Not on live electrics.
      icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3d094e70ca30eff47ab118e0663ba5cb, type: 3}
      color: {r: 0.94509804, g: 0.8901961, b: 0.70980394, a: 1}
    - heading: CO2 (black)
      text: 'Electrical and fuel fires. Weak on paper: it can reignite.'
      icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3d094e70ca30eff47ab118e0663ba5cb, type: 3}
      color: {r: 0.75, g: 0.75, b: 0.75, a: 1}
    - heading: Dry powder (blue)
      text: Works on all three fires here. Use it as a backup.
      icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3d094e70ca30eff47ab118e0663ba5cb, type: 3}
      color: {r: 0.3019608, g: 0.56078434, b: 0.8784314, a: 1}
  - title: 'PASS: using an extinguisher'
    body: 'Walk to the stand and tap an extinguisher to pick it up. Then:'
    items:
    - heading: Pull
      text: Tap the yellow pin, or press PULL PIN.
      icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 99103257c29331a46b2ba96d999ba545, type: 3}
      color: {r: 0.20392157, g: 0.78039217, b: 0.34901962, a: 1}
    - heading: Aim
      text: Point the phone at the BASE of the fire, not the flames.
      icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9a08ceb089d11fe49ba1987b319913e0, type: 3}
      color: {r: 0.3019608, g: 0.6392157, b: 1, a: 1}
    - heading: Squeeze
      text: Hold the SQUEEZE button to spray.
      icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3d094e70ca30eff47ab118e0663ba5cb, type: 3}
      color: {r: 0.9411765, g: 0.3529412, b: 0.15686275, a: 1}
    - heading: Sweep
      text: Move the phone slowly side to side across the base.
      icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0d1aed9e1ce520d49a080272fab3da1b, type: 3}
      color: {r: 1, g: 0.6901961, b: 0.1254902, a: 1}
  - title: Stay safe
    body: 
    items:
    - heading: Keep 1 to 2.5 m away
      text: Closer is dangerous. Further away and the spray cannot reach.
      icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d2361adf4ea98f2458aa4e19825b5876, type: 3}
      color: {r: 1, g: 0.6901961, b: 0.1254902, a: 1}
    - heading: Wrong agent = worse fire
      text: Water spreads burning fuel. Water on live electrics is fatal.
      icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: df2d29c973006d74aa4e41d3b17682d3, type: 3}
      color: {r: 1, g: 0.27058825, b: 0.22745098, a: 1}
    - heading: Extinguishers run out
      text: Each one lasts about 12 seconds of spraying.
      icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 71f439f3a7696f74d94f86ad4259cb7a, type: 3}
      color: {r: 0.3019608, g: 0.6392157, b: 1, a: 1}
    - heading: Walk around for real
      text: You will need to move around your room. Keep the floor clear.
      icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a14703f54fa5fbd47bb7f584997f670c, type: 3}
      color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
